WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.800
When we were outside the city

00:03.120 --> 00:04.520
Thank you, miss

00:05.360 --> 00:06.800
When grandfather immediately knelt

00:07.080 --> 00:08.600
It really startled me

00:09.840 --> 00:11.000
Your Highness

00:11.080 --> 00:13.000
Have you been standing here long?

00:14.400 --> 00:15.800
The melody is beautiful

00:16.240 --> 00:17.560
Can you play another?

00:17.640 --> 00:19.040
Mm

01:10.400 --> 01:11.720
This melody

01:11.800 --> 01:13.467
Is warmer than the last

01:15.960 --> 01:17.080
The previous one

01:17.160 --> 01:18.560
Was for the departed

01:19.040 --> 01:20.040
This one

01:20.120 --> 01:21.520
Is for Your Highness

01:21.920 --> 01:23.480
Even someone made of iron

01:23.560 --> 01:25.280
Needs to rest sometimes

01:26.560 --> 01:28.227
After hearing your two melodies

01:28.440 --> 01:29.840
I feel much better

01:33.040 --> 01:34.440
I see you, miss

01:34.600 --> 01:35.800
Don't know martial arts

01:35.880 --> 01:36.680
Why follow the volunteers

01:36.760 --> 01:38.760
To a dangerous place like Yiyang?

01:39.520 --> 01:41.187
Grandfather is my only family

01:41.400 --> 01:42.680
If I don't follow him

01:42.760 --> 01:44.320
Where else can I go?

